      <title>Philippe Pascal &amp; Philipp Garou – Je Te Noie De Coco (Single Version) [France, Disco Boogie] (1987) French Tropical disco boogie, produced as a commercial song for a TV-ad by liquor brand Marie Brizard, supposedly featuring Philippe Pascal, singer of New Wave bands Marquis de Sade and Marc Seerg.</title>
      <creator>New Wave</creator>
