      <title>Dance [UK, Post-Punk/New Wave/Minimal-Synth] (1980) Brutal yet catchy piece of post-punk avantgarde electronic by the legendary partime Psychic TV member and producer of acts such as Clock DVA, Au Pairs and 23 Skidoo.</title>
